{"inkVersion":21,"root":[["^Bohdan, stráž Impéria. Vezu zprávy – a otázky. ","#","^reveal:name","/#","\n","^Redanie nás obviňuje z vraždy kurýra. Je to výmysl. ","#","^cut","/#","\n","ev","str","^Mají svědky v černém plášti.","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-0","flg":20},"ev","str","^V Poslu píšou, že vaši u hranice nebyli.","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-1","flg":20},"ev","str","^Pašeráci z Fereldenu?","/str","/ev",{"*":"0.c-2","flg":20},{"c-0":["\n","^Svědky si koupíte za pár grošů. ","#","^aff:self:-2 ","/#","#","^aff:k1:-1","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-1":["\n","^Přesně tak! Četl jste nás. ","#","^aff:self:+2 ","/#","#","^aff:k2:+2","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","^To je možné. Ferelden své stezky nehlídá. ","#","^aff:k3:-2 ","/#","#","^aff:k2:+1 ","/#","#","^aff:self:+1","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-0"},{"#f":5}],"g-0":["^Jsem z Nilfgaardu a pyšně to říkám. ","#","^reveal:faction","/#","\n","ev","str","^Tady se o politice nemluví.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-3","flg":20},"ev","str","^Mluvte, poslouchám.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-4","flg":20},"ev","str","^Míru máme všichni dost.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-5","flg":20},{"c-3":["\n","^Dobrá. Ale ta Mira z Redanie – jestli tu je – lže jako dýchá. ","#","^aff:mira:-2 ","/#","#","^aff:self:+1 ","/#","#","^aff:k1:-1","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"accused_mira","re":true},{"->":"0.g-1"},{"#f":5}],"c-4":["\n","^Mír visí na vlásku. Dávejte pozor, komu nalejete. ","#","^cut ","/#","#","^aff:self:+2 ","/#","#","^aff:k2:+1","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-1"},{"#f":5}],"c-5":["\n","^Pak jste slepý, anebo bohatý. ","#","^aff:self:-2 ","/#","#","^aff:k2:-1","/#","\n",{"->":"0.g-1"},{"#f":5}]}],"g-1":["^Smlouva bez pečeti je hadr. A hadr zapaluje války. ","#","^cut","/#","\n","ev","str","^Pomůžete pečeť najít?","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-6","flg":20},"ev","str","^Ať se království domluví bez vás.","/str","/ev",{"*":".^.c-7","flg":20},{"c-6":["\n","^Najít? Spíš zjistit, kdo ji zlomil. ","#","^aff:self:+1 ","/#","#","^aff:k2:+1","/#","\n",{"->"